  "This document is end-to-end encrypted. Collaborators without a personal passphrase will need the document password shared with them through a secure channel outside of Fidus Writer. Do not send the password through the document chat.": "该文档是端到端加密的。没有个人密码的协作者将需要通过 Fidus Writer 外部的安全通道与他们共享文档密码。不要通过文档聊天发送密码。",
